WEBVTT

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.025
When he showed up, Mohamed found out

00:00:31.049 --> 00:00:34.956
that the host had neglected to mention
a few things about the audience.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.436
ME: The first one is,
they are precious metal traders.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.370
AG: You know, people
who trade in one of the most volatile,

00:00:42.394 --> 00:00:44.120
risky financial products out there.

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.456
ME: Which means their attention span
is a few minutes at most.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.405
And second, he said,
"They've been drinking for the last hour.

00:00:50.429 --> 00:00:52.017
So they're a bit rowdy."

00:00:52.041 --> 00:00:54.752
I said, "OK." (Chuckles)
"Is there something else?"

00:00:54.776 --> 00:00:56.556
He said, "Yeah, just one more thing.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:02.863
Last year, the person who did it
lost control of the crowd,